### 

@base = http://localhost:5001

GET {{base}}/puzzles/archive HTTP/1.1


### Create a new puzzle

POST {{base}}/puzzles HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categories": [
    {
      "name": "Famous Scientists",
      "words": [
        {
          "text": "Newton"
        },
        {
          "text": "Einstein"
        },
        {
          "text": "Curie"
        },
        {
          "text": "Darwin"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
